    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d653">

                <pb facs="0767" n="665" xml:id="pg665"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.003/566: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-06-25T12:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 25, 1919,
                                noon</hi>.</date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received June 25,
                            9.23 a.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>All other powers concerned having accepted the revised import tariff the
                    provisional acceptance authorized by your telegram of March 27th, 6 p.m.<anchor
                        n="87" xml:id="d653-f1"/> was communicated to the Foreign Office on June
                    9th. The Chinese Foreign Office has now notified the several Legations that the
                    revised tariff will be published on July 1st and put into effect from August
                    1st.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
